{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33044","headline":"江西送人 · 曹邺","name":"江西送人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八月江上楼，西风令人愁。\n携酒楼上别，尽见四山秋。\n但愁今日知，莫作他时疑。\n郎本不住此，无人泣望归。\n何水不生波，何木不改柯。\n遥知明日恨，不如今日多。\n将心速投人，路远人如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33044.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33044","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}